; abnf stdio.semio.model diff (binary form)
; `encode_diff`/`decode_diff` carry NO envelope -- the binary form is exactly the UTF-8 bytes of
; `print_diff()`'s one-line text (see the sibling 📡️component.protocol.semio and
; ../📝️text/📖️component.grammar.semio for the `line` grammar those bytes decode as).
document = line-bytes
line-bytes = 1*OCTET  ; UTF-8 encoding of the text-facet `line` production, to end of stream
